<h1 class="contract">init</h1>
---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Initialize Contract Admin
summary: 'Set the admin account for contract management.'
---
This action sets the admin account for contract management. Only contract self can call this action. The admin will be required for all future management actions.

<h1 class="contract">addrushsale</h1>
---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Create Rush Sale
summary: 'Create a new rush sale event.'
---
Admin creates a new rush sale event with specified show, ticket, time, price, win ratio, and ticket count. Only admin can call this action.

<h1 class="contract">delrushsale</h1>
---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Delete Rush Sale
summary: 'Delete a rush sale event.'
---
Admin deletes a rush sale event by id. If forced is true, deletion occurs even if tickets have been sold. Only admin can call this action.

<h1 class="contract">updrushsale</h1>
---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Update Rush Sale
summary: 'Update rush sale parameters.'
---
Admin can update rush sale parameters (win ratio, max grabs per user, total tickets, end time). Each parameter is optional and only updated if provided. Only admin can call this action.

<h1 class="contract">delusers</h1>
---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Delete Rush Sale Users
summary: 'Batch delete users for a rush sale.'
---
Admin can batch delete users for a rush sale, up to max_count per call. Only admin can call this action.

<h1 class="contract">on_transfer</h1>
---
spec_version: "0.2.0"
title: Grab Sale Ticket
summary: 'Handle incoming token transfer for grabbing tickets.'
---
Triggered automatically when tokens are transferred from nestar.cisum. Handles ticket grabbing logic for users. Memo format must be "grab:<rush_sale_id>". Only valid during rush sale period.
